                                                "sense_id": "07c5764e-28c2-387d-bdcd-9bb960944bab",
                                                "text": "Tonight’s sumptuous two-hour gig butts up hard against the curfew. Minutes often go by during which Murphy dispenses entirely with the business of singing pop songs. She’ll vogue, or reanimate some acid house moves, letting the beat take over."
                                            },
