                                                "sense_id": "07c5764e-28c2-387d-bdcd-9bb960944bab",
                                                "text": "“Come on, this is boring!” “Okay... little man, bring your best.” (crowd cheering, clamoring) “Okay, looks like the little guy's voguing now. Whoa!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
